# ============================================================================
# SCHEDULED JOBS (Vercel Cron)
# ============================================================================

# Shared bearer token for the cron routes declared in apps/web/vercel.json.
# Vercel Cron sends `Authorization: Bearer $CRON_SECRET` on every scheduled tick
# and the routes accept nothing else, so leaving this unset makes them return 401
# and the expired-OAuth-state cleanup plus the stuck-PM-sync watchdog silently
# stop running. Required in every deployed environment that runs the schedule.
# Not needed locally — nothing invokes those routes there.
# Generate with `openssl rand -base64 32`.
CRON_SECRET=""

